60170 GCOLOR 11:GTEXT ZX+2,62,0,ZM,ZT$:GCOLOR 14:GTEXT ZX,60,0,ZM,ZT$
60180 ZL=LEN(ZA$):ZX=INT((320-ZL*8)/2):GCOLOR 1:GTEXT ZX,96,0,1,ZA$
